---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import WaveformLab from "../../components/WaveformLab.tsx";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Diversification: Waveforms"
  description="Diversification from first principles: how out-of-phase ups and downs cancel out, shown as interfering waves."
>
  <section class="container wl-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Interactive Tool · Part 1</p>
    <h1>Diversification, as waves</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Before the noise of real markets, here's the pure idea. Picture each
      asset's ups and downs as a smooth wave. When two assets don't move in
      lockstep, their waves are <em>out of phase</em> — and where one is up, the
      other is often down. Add them together and the bumps partly cancel. That
      cancellation is diversification.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="container wl-host">
    <WaveformLab client:load />
  </section>

  <section class="container wl-explainer">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>What you're looking at</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Top band:</strong> each asset as a wave. Taller wave = more
          volatile (bigger swings). Its <strong>correlation</strong> sets its
          phase: at +1 the waves line up; at −1 they're mirror images.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Bottom band:</strong> your weighted portfolio — the sum of the
          waves. The dashed lines mark how big the swing <em>would</em> be if the
          waves simply stacked. The gap down to the solid wave is the risk that
          cancelled away.
        </li>
        <li>
          Slide the correlation toward <strong>−1</strong> and watch the
          portfolio wave flatten toward a straight line — near-perfect
          cancellation, the "free lunch" in its purest form.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        This is deliberately idealized: real returns don't repeat in tidy sine
        waves, and they never cancel this perfectly. Next, see what happens when
        we add real randomness in the
        <a href="/tools/portfolio">Portfolio Diversification Lab</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .wl-intro {
    padding-block: var(--space-lg) var(--space-md);
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }
  .lede {
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .wl-explainer {
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
  }
</style>

<style is:global>
  .wl {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .wl {
      grid-template-columns: 320px 1fr;
      align-items: start;
    }
  }

  /* Controls */
  .wl-controls {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: var(--space-md);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  .wl-simmode {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-self: flex-start;
    background: var(--color-surface-alt);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 3px;
    gap: 3px;
  }
  .wl-simmode button {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .wl-simmode button.active {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  .wl-assets {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }
  .wl-asset {
    border: var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: var(--space-sm);
    background: var(--color-bg);
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }
  .wl-asset-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
  }
  .wl-swatch {
    width: 0.8rem;
    height: 0.8rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
    flex: none;
  }
  .wl-asset-name {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .wl-name-input {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 600;
    border: none;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--color-border);
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-text);
    width: 8rem;
  }
  .wl-name-input:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-bottom-color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .wl-weight-badge {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .wl-remove {
    border: none;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1;
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 0 0.2rem;
  }
  .wl-remove:hover:not(:disabled) {
    color: var(--color-error);
  }
  .wl-remove:disabled {
    opacity: 0.3;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }
  .wl-slider {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
  }
  .wl-slider span strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .wl-slider input[type="range"] {
    width: 100%;
    accent-color: var(--color-accent);
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .wl-corr {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    padding: var(--space-sm);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-accent);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--color-accent-soft);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
  }
  .wl-corr-label {
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
  }
  .wl-corr-label strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .wl-corr input[type="range"] {
    width: 100%;
    accent-color: var(--color-accent);
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .wl-corr-hint {
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }
  .wl-add-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .wl-add {
    flex: 1;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    padding: 0.5rem;
    border: var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    color: var(--color-text);
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .wl-btn {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.8rem;
    border: var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    color: var(--color-text);
    cursor: pointer;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .wl-btn:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  /* Stage */
  .wl-stage {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .wl-canvas {
    width: 100%;
    height: 340px;
    display: block;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  .wl-lower {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    align-items: start;
  }
  @media (min-width: 1100px) {
    .wl-lower {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }
  .wl-readout {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    padding: var(--space-md);
  }
  .wl-frontier {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    padding: var(--space-md);
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .wl-frontier h3 {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-sm);
    font-size: var(--step-1);
  }
  .wl-flegend {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem 0.9rem;
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
  }
  .wl-flegend span {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }
  .wl-fdot {
    width: 0.7rem;
    height: 0.7rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    flex: none;
  }
  .wl-fdot--cur {
    background: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .wl-fdot--mv {
    background: var(--color-link);
  }
  .wl-fdot--as {
    background: var(--color-muted);
  }
  .wl-fnote {
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-style: italic;
    margin: var(--space-sm) 0 0;
  }
  .wl-bar {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }
  .wl-bar-label {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
  }
  .wl-bar-value {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .wl-bar-track {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    height: 0.6rem;
    background: var(--color-surface-alt);
    border-radius: 999px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .wl-bar-fill {
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 999px;
    transition: width var(--transition);
  }
  .wl-bar-fill--avg {
    background: var(--color-muted);
  }
  .wl-bar-fill--port {
    background: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .wl-saved {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
    margin: var(--space-sm) 0 0;
  }
  .wl-saved strong {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .wl-note {
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
